Text: Predicting the Role of Political Trolls in Social Media Gianmarco De Francisci Morales Atanas Atanasov ISI Foundation Soﬁa University Bulgaria gdfm@acm.org amitkov@uni-sofia.bg Abstract We investigate the political roles of “Inter- arXiv:1910.02001v1 [cs.CL] 4 Oct 2019 net trolls” in social media. Political trolls, such as the ones linked to the Russian In- ternet Research Agency (IRA), have recently gained enormous attention for their ability to sway public opinion and even inﬂuence elections.

